	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mitto tibi, colendissime domine compater, responsum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nostrum <placeName ref="l167">Genevatibus</placeName> in causa <persName ref="p6589">Serveti</persName> datum, simulque cum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>eo excerptos ex eiusdem <persName ref="p6589">Serveti</persName> libris et scriptis errores, si<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cut eos iussi ad senatum nostrum retulimus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Si libet hęc in<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>spicere, bene, potes curare, ut describantur; sin minus, ipsum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tamen exemplar remitte mihi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Remitto ego quoque tibi <placeName ref="l28">Basilie<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nsis</placeName> responsi exemplar et ago gratias pro illius communicatione.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Novi nihil habemus, nisi quod de <persName>Vercellis</persName> a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> captis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>multa variaque feruntur; aiunt quidam direptam tan<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tum a <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fuisse civitatem, postea vero relictam, alii teneri eam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ab iisdem volunt; nondum cognovi certi quicquam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hodie mercatores <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ex <placeName ref="l301">Lugduno</placeName> venientes retulerunt mihi multos rusticos <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in <placeName ref="l2589">Picardia</placeName> a Caesareanis trucidatos, quorum opera rex <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>in reparando utebatur Hedino.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ita alternis utrinque et vin<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>cunt et vincuntur crudelissimi tyranni.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> non <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>habemus quicquam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tumultum tamen inter episcopum <placeName ref="l18">Augustanum</placeName> et <persName>Boum<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>gartnerum</persName> sedatum rursum esse aiunt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quod christianos concer<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nit in praefecturis <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> Italicis commorantes, spero nostros <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sua ope illis non defuturos et urgebo eos graviter, ut faciunt <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>suum officium.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cum <placeName ref="l160">Friburgensibus</placeName> nostro magistratui nunc lis est <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>propter dominia quędam comitatus <placeName>Grueriensis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Habebuntur <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>comitia <placeName ref="l379">Paterniaci</placeName> ad proximam diem solis, in quibus decernetur <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>aliquid de hac controversia.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l160">Friburgenses</placeName> occupaturi erant vi quędam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>castra; sed nostri praevenientes continuerunt eos domi, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>donec iure, cui cedant, decernatur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vereor, ne contingat his urbibus, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quod <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> aliquando cum <placeName>Svitensibus</placeName> contigit; ferociunt <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>enim valde <placeName ref="l160">Friburgenses</placeName>, auxilio freti cantonum nostrorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> venit ad nos <persName>Franciscus Molinęus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>natione alias <persName>Gallus</persName>; ille deploranda de istius regni refert statu.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p8111">Petrum Martyrem</persName> <placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName> esse dicit, tres vero oneratas <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>exulibus naves in <placeName ref="l825">Daniam</placeName> traiecisse regemque <persName ref="p3671">Danum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ipsis hospitium et ecclesias in suo regno concessisse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">De d. <persName ref="p8041">a Lasco</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>refert, quod eo ipso die voluerit discedere, quo discedebat <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ipse, sed evocatum esse ad reginam, unde se scire non posse, quid <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>cum illo agatur.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l1255">Cantuariensem</placeName>, <placeName ref="l177">Glocestriensem</placeName>, <placeName ref="l296">Londinensem</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>et <placeName ref="l2616">Excestriensem</placeName> espicopos in vinculis esse, principem Northum<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>bellandię captum et obtruncatum, <placeName ref="l553">Vintoniensem</placeName> constitutum a<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>rchicancellarium et praesidem parlamenti et miseram esse <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>confusionem in toto regno.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sed non dubito, quin tu de his habeas <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>certiora.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Volui tamen haec scribere, ut meam tibi testarer fidem.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Vale.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te omnes nostri; saluta meo nomine uxorem et fa<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>miliam tuam universam una cum dominis fratribus et symmystis <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>colendissimis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 5. decembris 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8018">Ioan[nes] Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l49">Bielnas</placeName> misi fasciculum illum <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>literarum, quem misisti, mox postquam <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>recepi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et compatri suo unice co<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>lendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Bullingeren</persName>.</s>
				</p>
